<span id="S4.T2.3.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Ours (<math id="S4.T2.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{adapt}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>adapt</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{adapt}}</annotation></semantics></math>, after filtering)</span>
