<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Uncertainty signals</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T6" title="Table A6 ‣ E.2 Uncertainty signals ‣ Appendix E Ablation Details ‣ Towards Agents That Know When They Don’t Know: Uncertainty as a Control Signal for Structured Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A6</span></a> compares four uncertainty reward signals. CoCoA improves consistency but is compute-inefficient.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
