<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Judge robustness</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T7" title="Table A7 ‣ E.3 Judge robustness ‣ Appendix E Ablation Details ‣ Towards Agents That Know When They Don’t Know: Uncertainty as a Control Signal for Structured Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A7</span></a> gives correlations between <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{judge}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>g</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{judge}</annotation></semantics></math>, a weak LLM judge, and human labels. Preserved ranking: <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{adapt}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{adapt}</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{step}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{step}</annotation></semantics></math>¿ <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{phase}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{phase}</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{base}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{base}</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
